The default value for dark blue is 255, which is almost too dark to
see against a black background. (I drowned a character thanks to this)
Change the value to about 128.
This has been discusssed before on rgrn.

Of course if you really want to play on a white background (and cause
your eyeballs to bleed), you can do that too.
